  vendorName: Gardener Caelum
  offerText: Take this large, beautiful blooming orchid for your room. It is completely
    free, and its sweet scent is guaranteed to lift your spirits.
  acceptResultText: You place the giant flower in your room. Its breathtaking beauty
    and sweet fragrance make you feel incredibly peaceful and happy.
  rejectResultText: You refuse the strange plant. Your room smells a bit stale, but
    you prefer it that way.
  acceptedDelayedText: The orchid releases a thick cloud of highly toxic pollen while
    you sleep! You wake up choking, covered in painful hives, and utterly miserable.
